meta {
  name: 30-client-notifications
  seq: 30
}

docs {
  What newer official clients expect beyond the vault: the push hub, the
  notification center and the event upload.

  The push hub itself is a WebSocket speaking SignalR with MessagePack, which
  Bruno cannot drive. These requests only pin the HTTP side of it; the existing
  `npm run test:notifications-security` covers the hub.
}
